{
    "title": "GS Halloween Animated Face",
    "description": "Halloween - themed Wear OS watch face \r\n\r\nTo change the pumpkin face and other watch face options, please tap and hold on the screen. \r\n\r\nA phone app is needed for this watch face to function correctly (intercommunicate with the app below) This app acts as a service so you won't find it in your app launcher. Please make sure to install the mobile version first.\r\n\r\nThe watch face can be controlled from your phone (a separate application needs to be installed on your phone). This allows you to control all watchface settings, backup and restore customizations, and receive notifications from the watchface when the battery drops to the level you have set, or your heart rate bpm reaches the limit you have selected.\r\n\r\nDownload the Android companion app here https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.gs.watchfaces\r\n\r\n- 2 editable complications\r\n- Animated flames (on/off)\r\n- Change the pumpkin face (10 different faces)\r\n- Change colors to all elements, including AOD\r\n- Change fonts (5 Halloween fonts)\r\n- 12/24h format independent from the phone\r\n- User-selectable heart rate interval\r\n- Choose multilingual or English date format. If multilingual the date will have a different (non-themed) font.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Halloween - themed Wear OS watch face <br><br>To change the pumpkin face and other watch face options, please tap and hold on the screen. <br><br>A phone app is needed for this watch face to function correctly (intercommunicate with the app below) This app acts as a service so you won&#39;t find it in your app launcher. Please make sure to install the mobile version first.<br><br>The watch face can be controlled from your phone (a separate application needs to be installed on your phone). This allows you to control all watchface settings, backup and restore customizations, and receive notifications from the watchface when the battery drops to the level you have set, or your heart rate bpm reaches the limit you have selected.<br><br>Download the Android companion app here https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.gs.watchfaces<br><br>- 2 editable complications<br>- Animated flames (on/off)<br>- Change the pumpkin face (10 different faces)<br>- Change colors to all elements, including AOD<br>- Change fonts (5 Halloween fonts)<br>- 12/24h format independent from the phone<br>- User-selectable heart rate interval<br>- Choose multilingual or English date format. If multilingual the date will have a different (non-themed) font.",
